# SA 360 web — build-time variables (Vite inlines VITE_* values into the bundle, so never put secrets here).
#
# VITE_API_URL — base URL of the API including the /api suffix.
#   Leave it unset (recommended) to call same-origin /api:
#     - local development: Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:8080
#     - Docker: nginx proxies /api to the api container
#     - Vercel: vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the Render service
#   Same-origin keeps the HttpOnly refresh cookie first-party, which every browser (including Safari) accepts.
#   Set it only to call the API cross-site, e.g. VITE_API_URL=https://nexus360-api.onrender.com/api — the API then
#   needs FRONTEND_ORIGIN set to this site and COOKIE_SAME_SITE=None.
# VITE_API_URL=
